# Cloudflare Pages security headers
# 2026-05-09 Phase 1：codex 安全審查 #6 — 新增 CSP / 安全 headers
#
# 設計取捨：
#   - script-src 保留 'unsafe-inline'：站內多處 onclick="..." 與 token 接收 inline script，
#     轉成 nonce 是大重構，本次先上 CSP 守住其他向量。下個 phase 再把 inline 抽出。
#   - style-src 同樣留 'unsafe-inline'（許多 inline style 在動態 render 內）
#   - frame-ancestors 允許 chiyigo.com：frontchannel-logout.html 被 chiyigo iframe 嵌入用
#   - connect-src 列 chiyigo.com：JWKS / OIDC discovery / token endpoint / refresh / claim
#   - GA / GTM 走 googletagmanager.com / google-analytics.com
#   - chart.js / chartjs-plugin-datalabels / html2canvas 走 cdn.jsdelivr.net + cdnjs.cloudflare.com

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://chiyigo.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com; frame-src 'self' https://chiyigo.com; frame-ancestors 'self' https://chiyigo.com; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://chiyigo.com

# frontchannel-logout.html 必須允許被 chiyigo 主站 iframe 嵌入（OIDC front-channel logout）
# CSP 已含 frame-ancestors 'self' https://chiyigo.com，這裡 X-Frame-Options 覆蓋為 ALLOW-FROM 等價
/frontchannel-logout.html
  X-Frame-Options: ALLOW-FROM https://chiyigo.com
